Package: jocky-workstation
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0
Maintainer: JOCKY
Description: JOCKY forensic workstation
 Desktop client for the JOCKY defensive digital-forensics engine. Submits
 observation commands to a local engine over loopback HTTP and renders the
 engine's structured results and reports.
 .
 The client performs no forensic analysis of its own: parsing, validation,
 collection and report generation all belong to the engine.
